meta {
	name: 07_CannotWithdrawOtherSystemUsersRequest
	seq: 7
}

docs {
	Scenario: A system user cannot withdraw a request sent by another system user

		Given the system user has no pending sent request to the recipient
		When the system user requests the package from the recipient
		And another public sector system user tries to withdraw the request
		Then withdrawing fails with 400 and AM.VLD-00044 (Party cannot perform this status change)
		And the request is still pending for the system user that sent it
		Finally the system user that sent the request withdraws it to clean up

	Requires otherPublicSectorConsumer in testdata: a second KOMM, FYLK or STAT organisation that
	owns a different system user.
}
